Package: lumalink-studio
Version: @VERSION@
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libxcb-cursor0, libegl1
Recommends: v4l2loopback-dkms, adb
Maintainer: LumaLink <https://github.com/tryshyzov/lumacam>
Homepage: https://tryshyzov.github.io/lumacam/
Description: An Android phone's camera as a webcam
 LumaLink Studio receives video from the LumaLink app on an Android phone,
 over USB or Wi-Fi, and offers it to video apps as the "LumaLink Camera"
 webcam, through the v4l2loopback kernel module.
